discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy--news\">\n<span class=\"c-tease-card__tag\">News</span> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n<span class=\"c-tease-card__tag\">Eye health</span>\n<span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Sightsavers pledges five eye health commitments ahead of global summit</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers has vowed to improve eye care services and speed up progress towards eliminating avoidable blindness, ahead of the Global Summit for Eye Health.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/news/2026/10/sightsavers-launches-partnership-to-accelerate-disease-elimination-in-africa/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A boy drinks from a cup of water, held by an older woman, after taking medication to treat disease.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2502_Sightsavers-ismail-mda-schisto-nigeria-194433-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2502_Sightsavers-ismail-mda-schisto-nigeria-194433-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2502_Sightsavers-ismail-mda-schisto-nigeria-194433-300x169.jpg 1x\">\n</img></div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n<svg alt=\"news article icon\" class=\"svg-icon svg-cat\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" fill=\"#403b5e\" r=\"20\" stroke-width=\"0\"></circle>\n<rect fill=\"#fb2\" height=\"8.65\" stroke-width=\"0\" width=\"7.72\" x=\"10.03\" y=\"11.35\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M28.38,23.88H10.14c-.41,0-.75-.34-.75-.75s.34-.75.75-.75h18.23c.41,0,.75.34.75.75s-.34.75-.75.75Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n<path d=\"M28.38,27.51H10.14c-.41,0-.75-.34-.75-.75s.34-.75.75-.75h18.23c.41